WEBVTT

00:00.680 --> 00:03.480
♪Shrugging off past burdens♪

00:03.480 --> 00:06.070
♪Beneath the mask, who am I?♪

00:06.740 --> 00:10.140
♪Release and find wider shores♪

00:11.840 --> 00:14.850
♪Love's a riddle, and rain pours heavy♪

00:15.220 --> 00:17.750
♪Crossed paths, now downward fall♪

00:18.090 --> 00:21.530
♪From dust arises starlight's spark♪

00:23.280 --> 00:28.500
♪Tearing through
the night's dense blockade♪

00:29.180 --> 00:34.260
♪Heart's flame illuminates all solitude♪

00:35.060 --> 00:37.550
♪Let time's sails drift endlessly♪

00:37.550 --> 00:40.160
♪Through wandering exile♪

00:40.680 --> 00:47.940
♪Breaking free from the cocoon,
I start anew♪

00:48.910 --> 00:51.670
♪Moon as song, life as flame♪

00:51.730 --> 00:54.570
♪Nameless heart clings fiercely♪

00:54.860 --> 00:55.890
♪Let me♪

00:56.080 --> 01:00.160
♪Charge toward the next raging river♪

01:00.610 --> 01:03.290
♪Moon darts, snow falls♪

01:03.580 --> 01:06.280
♪We tread rugged paths to reunite♪

01:06.450 --> 01:07.920
♪Hands held tight♪

01:07.920 --> 01:12.090
♪We forever live for love's sake♪

01:12.450 --> 01:22.700
♪Shadow's spear burns fiercely♪

01:24.130 --> 01:29.680
=Legend of The Female General=

01:29.880 --> 01:32.539
=Episode 16=

01:33.110 --> 01:34.229
Actually,

01:34.590 --> 01:37.030
there is something

01:37.400 --> 01:39.150
I need your help with.

01:40.590 --> 01:41.630
I'm glad to help.

01:42.030 --> 01:43.110
Just say the word.

01:50.830 --> 01:53.030
A man named Chai Anxi

01:53.470 --> 01:55.190
currently resides in Jiyang.

01:55.590 --> 01:56.670
Could you

01:57.310 --> 01:59.470
get rid of him for me?

02:03.910 --> 02:04.750
Xiuluo Boutique

02:04.950 --> 02:05.630
is the biggest

02:05.790 --> 02:06.790
local clothing store.

02:07.190 --> 02:07.790
They also

02:07.950 --> 02:09.590
sell trendy accessories.

02:09.990 --> 02:11.670
Huaijin asked me to find this place.

02:12.030 --> 02:13.630
He said that the guests at the banquet

02:13.830 --> 02:15.470
will be local nobility.

02:15.870 --> 02:16.390
So,

02:16.790 --> 02:17.670
it's your chance

02:17.710 --> 02:18.310
to establish

02:18.630 --> 02:19.510
(Xiuluo Boutique)
yourselves in Jiyang.

02:20.110 --> 02:20.710
Dress

02:20.950 --> 02:22.310
to impress.

02:22.780 --> 02:23.310
Here we are.

02:29.829 --> 02:30.990
Clothes make the man.

02:30.990 --> 02:31.910
Ask Huaijin

02:31.950 --> 02:33.590
to buy you a nice dress.

02:33.590 --> 02:34.390
Cheng Lisu.

02:35.110 --> 02:35.950
Thank you, Commander.

02:41.590 --> 02:42.230
Let's go.

02:45.670 --> 02:47.030
What? I want a dress, too.

02:47.230 --> 02:48.190
Stop being

02:48.190 --> 02:49.180
the third wheel.

02:49.270 --> 02:50.110
They're not really...

02:50.110 --> 02:50.790
Come on.

02:51.230 --> 02:51.950
Let's check out

02:52.070 --> 02:52.630
the herb shop

02:52.750 --> 02:53.870
for your book.

03:03.910 --> 03:05.550
Are you looking for clothes, Madam?

03:05.910 --> 03:06.490
Yeah.

03:06.670 --> 03:07.590
Welcome

03:07.670 --> 03:08.590
to the biggest

03:08.590 --> 03:09.750
clothing store in Jiyang.

03:10.390 --> 03:10.910
Please.

03:26.970 --> 03:29.780
(Daughter of the Censor)

03:56.230 --> 03:57.030
My apologies.

03:58.590 --> 03:59.829
My handkerchief

03:59.950 --> 04:01.070
dropped and disturbed you.

04:08.150 --> 04:09.230
Honey, if you like this,

04:09.790 --> 04:10.470
just buy it.

04:13.620 --> 04:14.270
Sir,

04:14.350 --> 04:15.550
you have excellent taste.

04:16.029 --> 04:16.910
Once your wife

04:16.910 --> 04:17.670
puts on

04:17.670 --> 04:19.470
this lotus-pink peony dress,

04:20.390 --> 04:21.190
she'll resemble

04:21.190 --> 04:22.750
a fairy from paintings.

04:27.190 --> 04:27.750
Sir.

04:28.310 --> 04:29.950
My lady will take this dress.

04:35.670 --> 04:36.630
Miss Yan.

04:36.990 --> 04:38.190
I apologize for

04:38.350 --> 04:39.110
neglecting you.

04:39.750 --> 04:41.350
Madam, perhaps,

04:42.110 --> 04:43.950
you could pick something else.

04:50.940 --> 04:51.540
Sir.

04:51.830 --> 04:53.510
- This one...
- We will take that, too.

05:18.710 --> 05:19.260
Sir.

05:19.670 --> 05:21.070
Are there more clothes in there?

05:21.550 --> 05:22.110
Yes, Madam.

05:22.310 --> 05:23.910
Those are our most exclusive pieces,

05:24.190 --> 05:25.670
including our finest

05:25.950 --> 05:28.310
mermaid-silk celestial gown.

05:28.870 --> 05:29.430
Alright.

05:32.470 --> 05:33.080
Honey.

05:33.510 --> 05:34.350
Please wait here

05:34.670 --> 05:35.790
while I take a look.

05:46.030 --> 05:46.630
Sir,

05:47.430 --> 05:49.110
I'm Yan Min'er, daughter of

05:49.110 --> 05:49.830
Censor Yan Ling.

05:50.430 --> 05:52.070
May I ask your name?

06:03.450 --> 06:03.990
Madam,

06:04.350 --> 06:06.150
this heavenly fragrance dress is simple

06:06.270 --> 06:07.030
and elegant.

06:07.430 --> 06:08.270
And it complements

06:08.590 --> 06:09.550
your complexion.

06:09.990 --> 06:11.470
It would be a nice dress to wear

06:11.910 --> 06:12.870
to any banquet.

06:12.910 --> 06:13.950
- Miss Yan, here.
- You

06:13.950 --> 06:15.350
will outshine everyone else.

06:16.350 --> 06:17.710
Alright, I'll take it.

06:17.790 --> 06:19.450
My lady will take that one, too.

06:25.390 --> 06:26.070
Miss,

06:27.110 --> 06:28.870
have I offended you somehow?

06:29.590 --> 06:30.150
Not at all.

06:30.810 --> 06:31.430
I'm simply

06:31.430 --> 06:32.630
shopping for clothes.

06:33.350 --> 06:34.350
You're overthinking.

06:36.550 --> 06:37.350
In that case,

06:37.990 --> 06:39.470
let's go by who came first.

06:40.070 --> 06:41.110
I've claimed this dress.

06:41.110 --> 06:42.470
If you like it,

06:42.670 --> 06:43.550
the shop owner

06:43.670 --> 06:45.110
can get you another one.

06:46.830 --> 06:48.350
Classic country mindset.

06:48.670 --> 06:50.230
All garments here

06:50.230 --> 06:51.230
are one-of-a-kind.

06:51.909 --> 06:53.670
I have picked this one.

06:54.390 --> 06:55.270
Pick something else.

06:57.750 --> 06:58.830
Are you going to pick

06:58.950 --> 06:59.790
whatever I choose

06:59.990 --> 07:01.030
from now on?

07:01.390 --> 07:01.910
Well,

07:01.910 --> 07:03.230
it depends on how I feel.

07:11.070 --> 07:11.930
Sir.

07:12.430 --> 07:13.990
This, this, and these two...

07:14.030 --> 07:15.470
My lady will take them all.

07:16.890 --> 07:17.400
Well...

07:18.390 --> 07:19.910
Madam, will you...

07:20.710 --> 07:21.870
Don't worry, sir.

07:22.350 --> 07:23.710
I wanted to say that

07:24.150 --> 07:25.110
I picked those dresses

07:25.230 --> 07:26.750
for this young lady.

07:27.710 --> 07:28.430
You tricked me.

07:29.230 --> 07:30.670
Do you have any idea who I am?

07:31.710 --> 07:32.750
No, I don't.

07:33.230 --> 07:34.550
But I'm sure you're from

07:34.790 --> 07:35.510
a wealthy family.

07:36.030 --> 07:36.630
However,

07:36.870 --> 07:38.110
your upbringing seems lacking.

07:38.470 --> 07:39.150
You should know

07:39.590 --> 07:41.590
that those who rest
on their ancestors' laurels

07:41.790 --> 07:43.190
may squander their inheritance.

07:43.260 --> 07:43.860
You...!

07:45.590 --> 07:46.390
What happened?

07:49.270 --> 07:50.190
Sir,

07:50.750 --> 07:52.390
I merely picked the same dress

07:52.550 --> 07:54.070
as this lady.

07:54.630 --> 07:55.430
If she truly

07:55.430 --> 07:56.830
likes this dress,

07:57.470 --> 07:58.590
I'll give it up.

07:59.550 --> 08:00.570
But

08:00.710 --> 08:01.510
she toyed with me

08:01.510 --> 08:02.750
on purpose,

08:03.510 --> 08:05.590
which made me feel humiliated.

08:06.550 --> 08:07.630
I was asking my wife.

08:08.670 --> 08:09.670
I only trust her.

08:12.350 --> 08:13.190
Didn't you mention

08:13.430 --> 08:14.470
a collection piece?

08:15.030 --> 08:16.190
Bring it for my wife.

08:16.630 --> 08:17.470
Naturally,

08:17.510 --> 08:18.630
she deserves only

08:18.750 --> 08:19.790
the finest garments.

08:22.300 --> 08:23.590
Please follow me.

08:38.830 --> 08:39.390
Sir,

08:39.700 --> 08:41.350
I dare say that this gown

08:41.590 --> 08:42.230
doesn't exist

08:42.309 --> 08:44.390
anywhere else throughout Wei.

08:45.510 --> 08:46.390
The fabric

08:46.510 --> 08:48.030
was purchased at great cost

08:48.110 --> 08:49.230
from an overseas merchant.

08:49.590 --> 08:51.230
But the true marvel

08:51.390 --> 08:52.990
lies in the detachable shawl.

08:53.790 --> 08:55.630
Steeped in alchemical solutions,

08:55.870 --> 08:56.870
it's impenetrable.

08:57.470 --> 08:58.390
It looks nice

08:58.750 --> 08:59.550
and offers

08:59.790 --> 09:00.670
protection.

09:01.350 --> 09:02.190
If you like it,

09:02.230 --> 09:03.350
let Madam try it on.

09:03.910 --> 09:04.510
How much is it?

09:05.470 --> 09:06.150
One hundred.

09:07.540 --> 09:08.110
Miss,

09:08.350 --> 09:09.310
we should leave.

09:09.630 --> 09:10.550
Master will punish you

09:10.550 --> 09:11.910
for spending a fortune

09:12.310 --> 09:13.110
on one dress.

09:14.430 --> 09:15.430
Only a hundred.

09:16.990 --> 09:18.350
As long as it pleases my wife,

09:19.030 --> 09:19.830
it's worth it.

09:34.710 --> 09:35.590
Does it look good?

09:36.630 --> 09:37.270
Yeah.

09:44.790 --> 09:45.390
Miss,

09:46.350 --> 09:47.190
settle your bill.

09:48.070 --> 09:49.430
It's a small business

09:49.590 --> 09:50.150
that relies

09:50.150 --> 09:51.310
on your generous patronage.

09:52.700 --> 09:53.350
Pay up.

09:56.990 --> 09:57.590
Thank you.

09:57.850 --> 09:58.550
Sir,

09:59.060 --> 09:59.670
I've helped

09:59.670 --> 10:00.670
with your business.

10:00.870 --> 10:01.790
Won't you thank me?

10:02.310 --> 10:04.110
Thank you, Madam.

10:16.430 --> 10:16.950
Alright.

10:22.790 --> 10:24.190
I'll take you along next time.

10:24.190 --> 10:25.630
That's a promise, then.

10:26.190 --> 10:27.950
So you came alone?

10:27.950 --> 10:28.670
Min'er.

10:28.950 --> 10:29.830
Isn't it

10:29.950 --> 10:31.270
Xiuluo Boutique's latest design?

10:31.550 --> 10:32.150
So pretty.

10:32.870 --> 10:33.470
Of course.

10:33.710 --> 10:35.350
No one brings out its elegance

10:35.350 --> 10:36.590
better than you, Min'er.

10:40.630 --> 10:41.270
They'll be here.

10:41.270 --> 10:42.790
Mr. Cui's nephew and niece-in-law

10:42.790 --> 10:43.830
have such a lofty air.

10:44.550 --> 10:45.390
They're so late

10:45.390 --> 10:46.270
for the banquet.

10:46.830 --> 10:47.590
I heard

10:47.710 --> 10:49.030
they're from Wuzhou.

10:49.630 --> 10:51.230
Small-town folks lack etiquette.

10:51.510 --> 10:53.270
They've probably never been to banquets.

10:53.710 --> 10:55.430
Who knows how they will embarrass

10:55.430 --> 10:56.230
themselves?

10:56.440 --> 10:57.000
Yeah.

11:28.430 --> 11:28.950
Alright.

11:30.030 --> 11:30.950
This is Master's

11:30.950 --> 11:32.670
nephew Qiao Huanqing,

11:33.070 --> 11:34.390
and our niece-in-law

11:34.550 --> 11:35.640
Wen Yuyan.

11:36.030 --> 11:37.310
Please be seated.

11:38.360 --> 11:38.990
Come on.

11:38.990 --> 11:41.830
Qiao Huanqing is so handsome

11:41.830 --> 11:42.910
with refined grace.

11:43.510 --> 11:44.550
But his wife

11:44.790 --> 11:45.850
is utterly detestable.

11:46.550 --> 11:47.270
She offended you?

11:47.990 --> 11:48.550
Don't worry.

11:49.150 --> 11:50.350
I'll put her in her place.

11:55.270 --> 11:55.950
What's wrong?

11:59.270 --> 12:00.630
Originally there was nothing.

12:00.750 --> 12:02.470
Where could dust arise?

12:03.470 --> 12:04.830
What a lady-killer.

12:14.580 --> 12:15.270
Mr. Cui,

12:15.670 --> 12:16.550
let me toast you.

12:16.710 --> 12:17.830
Cheers.

12:20.510 --> 12:21.070
It's nice.

12:22.390 --> 12:22.950
Come on.

12:34.390 --> 12:35.590
Honey.

12:42.630 --> 12:44.470
I'd like some soup.

12:44.630 --> 12:46.470
Would you serve me a bowl?

13:03.630 --> 13:05.030
No wonder you're furious.

13:05.670 --> 13:06.990
She does employ cunning tricks.

13:14.430 --> 13:15.270
Mrs. Qiao.

13:30.070 --> 13:31.270
You're too delicate,

13:32.070 --> 13:33.240
relying on your husband

13:33.350 --> 13:34.510
for every little thing.

13:35.670 --> 13:37.180
You haven't been married yet.

13:37.310 --> 13:38.110
So you don't get

13:38.110 --> 13:39.630
the playful intimacy.

13:40.230 --> 13:41.030
Or perhaps

13:41.270 --> 13:42.230
you wish to be

13:42.230 --> 13:43.190
neglected

13:43.430 --> 13:44.670
by your future husband?

13:49.510 --> 13:51.590
A woman must
demonstrate dignified conduct

13:51.830 --> 13:53.270
to earn her husband's respect.

13:54.150 --> 13:54.910
You're merely

13:55.030 --> 13:56.430
relying on your looks

13:56.710 --> 13:57.670
to play the temptress.

13:58.350 --> 13:59.830
Mr. Qiao, you must be careful

14:00.710 --> 14:02.990
not to be tempted by mere appearance.

14:14.990 --> 14:15.590
I am

14:16.070 --> 14:18.170
playing the temptress?

14:18.550 --> 14:19.870
So she's into me,

14:20.390 --> 14:21.110
and not you?

14:22.190 --> 14:23.910
Maybe you made quite an impression

14:24.390 --> 14:25.190
at Xiuluo Boutique,

14:25.790 --> 14:26.390
making her

14:26.710 --> 14:28.150
thoroughly captivated.

14:28.950 --> 14:29.790
Tell you what.

14:30.350 --> 14:31.870
Save the snide remarks.

14:32.350 --> 14:33.870
She was obviously infuriated

14:34.390 --> 14:35.270
because

14:35.270 --> 14:37.230
you spent a fortune on that dress

14:37.230 --> 14:38.680
you bought me.

14:39.000 --> 14:40.020
I bet she's going to

14:40.190 --> 14:41.950
look for trouble again.

14:42.310 --> 14:43.870
This is all your fault.

14:45.390 --> 14:48.070
Weren't you very confident?

14:49.070 --> 14:50.170
Now you fear trouble?

14:55.990 --> 14:56.710
Mr. Cui,

14:57.350 --> 14:58.870
at this joyous

14:58.950 --> 14:59.910
family reunion,

15:00.190 --> 15:01.190
I volunteer

15:01.350 --> 15:02.430
to play a musical piece

15:02.590 --> 15:03.430
for celebration.

15:03.590 --> 15:04.430
Alright.

15:04.710 --> 15:06.270
Xiu is renowned as Jiyang's

15:06.270 --> 15:07.430
most talented lady.

15:07.630 --> 15:09.070
You're in for a feast

15:09.230 --> 15:10.110
for the ears.

15:10.630 --> 15:12.030
Bring the zither.

16:03.830 --> 16:04.670
Exquisite playing.

16:04.870 --> 16:05.470
Beautiful.

16:05.470 --> 16:06.070
Wonderful.

16:16.110 --> 16:17.150
- Marvelous.
- Good.

16:20.710 --> 16:21.750
I hope you liked it.

16:27.960 --> 16:29.710
Here we go.

16:32.230 --> 16:33.390
We've heard Mrs. Qiao

16:33.390 --> 16:34.870
is renowned in Wuzhou

16:35.390 --> 16:37.710
for her peerless musical talents.

16:38.110 --> 16:39.630
Fate brought us here today.

16:39.990 --> 16:41.070
May I have

16:41.190 --> 16:42.870
the honor of admiring your music?

16:45.950 --> 16:47.190
You are indeed

16:47.550 --> 16:48.950
a peerless zither artist.

16:49.670 --> 16:51.990
I would rather not embarrass myself.

16:52.550 --> 16:53.390
Mrs. Qiao.

16:56.470 --> 16:57.670
I also wish to appreciate

16:57.670 --> 16:58.750
your zither music.

16:59.590 --> 17:00.230
If Xiu alone

17:00.230 --> 17:01.830
can't convince you to play,

17:02.190 --> 17:03.270
can I change your mind?

17:14.589 --> 17:15.750
Help me out.

17:16.630 --> 17:18.670
Didn't you learn a piece?

17:20.150 --> 17:22.069
I also learned circus stunts.

17:24.430 --> 17:26.510
Mrs. Qiao, what do you say?

17:27.030 --> 17:29.030
The elders are waiting.

17:30.070 --> 17:30.670
Indeed.

17:36.110 --> 17:37.710
Will you help or not?

17:40.630 --> 17:41.430
No.

17:54.030 --> 17:55.550
Honey.

17:58.670 --> 17:59.710
Honey.

18:05.790 --> 18:07.310
Speak properly.

18:08.990 --> 18:10.910
So you're helping me?

18:11.910 --> 18:13.190
Yuyan,

18:13.190 --> 18:14.590
are you not interested

18:14.630 --> 18:15.550
in the zither?

18:20.630 --> 18:21.310
To be honest,

18:22.350 --> 18:23.390
we made a vow when we

18:23.710 --> 18:24.350
got married.

18:24.910 --> 18:26.950
My wife's zither skills are exceptional,

18:27.190 --> 18:27.700
but

18:28.350 --> 18:29.550
she only plays for me.

18:31.070 --> 18:31.830
Therefore,

18:32.350 --> 18:33.270
she can't fulfill

18:33.270 --> 18:34.270
your wishes today.

18:35.910 --> 18:37.790
But you reunited

18:37.990 --> 18:40.070
with Mr. Cui today.

18:40.670 --> 18:41.630
Why can't you make

18:42.510 --> 18:43.070
one exception

18:43.110 --> 18:44.510
for all the guests here?

18:45.110 --> 18:46.350
My promise to my wife

18:48.950 --> 18:49.750
is unbreakable.

18:50.710 --> 18:51.550
If you insist,

18:52.470 --> 18:53.270
I'll play instead.

18:56.150 --> 18:58.070
You can play the zither?

18:58.970 --> 18:59.550
Only passably.

18:59.990 --> 19:01.790
Our ancestors were all military men.

19:02.310 --> 19:03.270
We've never cultivated

19:03.270 --> 19:04.430
such a refined talent.

19:04.710 --> 19:05.230
Attendants.

19:05.550 --> 19:07.390
Clean the zither.

19:07.630 --> 19:08.180
No need.

19:08.550 --> 19:09.190
I have mine.

19:26.430 --> 19:28.540
(Isn't it the zither I gave him?)

19:59.950 --> 20:00.550
Beautiful.

20:06.310 --> 20:06.830
Well...

20:22.110 --> 20:23.110
Xiao Jue,

20:25.230 --> 20:26.670
do you like me?

20:32.910 --> 20:33.630
(It's hard)

20:34.470 --> 20:35.510
(to find someone)

20:35.510 --> 20:36.550
(more outstanding)

20:37.270 --> 20:38.430
(and prettier than him.)

20:51.830 --> 20:52.630
What a gentleman.

20:53.030 --> 20:53.590
Wonderful.

20:55.390 --> 20:55.910
Huanqing,

20:56.630 --> 20:58.590
your music left us spellbound.

20:59.310 --> 21:00.390
Her Highness

21:00.750 --> 21:01.590
praised Miss Xiu

21:01.870 --> 21:03.310
as Jiyang's finest musician.

21:03.590 --> 21:05.310
Had she heard your performance,

21:05.710 --> 21:08.790
she would've showered you with praise.

21:10.200 --> 21:10.830
Indeed.

21:10.870 --> 21:11.830
It appears that

21:12.270 --> 21:14.030
Mr. Cui is accepting Mr. Qiao,

21:14.790 --> 21:16.270
so we can't treat him

21:16.270 --> 21:17.470
as a mere merchant.

21:18.110 --> 21:18.990
So what?

21:19.270 --> 21:20.830
He's still a merchant

21:21.270 --> 21:22.030
without manners

21:22.390 --> 21:23.710
who has offended you.

21:25.750 --> 21:26.430
You're right.

21:27.830 --> 21:28.750
We should

21:28.790 --> 21:29.870
teach them a lesson.

21:31.430 --> 21:31.950
Thank you.

21:33.110 --> 21:33.790
In fact,

21:35.110 --> 21:35.990
my zither skills

21:36.590 --> 21:38.710
are nothing
compared to my wife's mastery.

21:39.550 --> 21:40.270
Really?

21:41.630 --> 21:42.310
Yuyan,

21:42.590 --> 21:43.550
you must be

21:43.590 --> 21:44.870
a zither master.

21:46.150 --> 21:47.950
My husband spoils me.

21:48.510 --> 21:50.070
He indulges my every whim

21:50.470 --> 21:52.380
and exaggerates my skills.

22:00.590 --> 22:01.510
At first,

22:01.510 --> 22:02.550
I only found you handsome.

22:03.110 --> 22:04.190
But now I feel

22:04.470 --> 22:05.590
that you do resemble

22:05.830 --> 22:06.950
my late elder brother.

22:07.270 --> 22:07.870
Meanwhile,

22:08.230 --> 22:10.030
your temperament resembles mine.

22:10.710 --> 22:12.270
You're truly my family.

22:17.190 --> 22:18.630
I once held you when you were

22:19.390 --> 22:20.190
a newborn.

22:20.710 --> 22:21.710
Then you went missing.

22:22.270 --> 22:23.830
Your parents never let go

22:23.830 --> 22:24.630
until they died.

22:25.030 --> 22:25.590
If they knew

22:25.590 --> 22:27.430
you had turned out to be outstanding,

22:28.070 --> 22:29.510
they'd be overjoyed.

22:34.790 --> 22:35.390
Sorry.

22:35.910 --> 22:36.750
Why did I bring up

22:36.750 --> 22:37.790
the sad stories?

22:37.820 --> 22:38.360
Right?

22:39.030 --> 22:39.870
Huanqing, Yuyan.

22:40.270 --> 22:41.390
You're here just in time

22:41.990 --> 22:43.390
for the Start of Spring,

22:43.710 --> 22:45.590
which marks Jiyang's Water God Festival.

22:46.150 --> 22:47.030
You must go out

22:47.070 --> 22:48.070
and look around.

22:48.110 --> 22:48.750
You'll never

22:48.990 --> 22:50.110
want to leave after that.

22:50.790 --> 22:51.510
Start of Spring?

22:52.750 --> 22:53.270
Yeah.

22:53.430 --> 22:54.230
What's wrong?

22:55.350 --> 22:55.790
Nothing.

22:56.270 --> 22:57.950
It happens to be

22:57.990 --> 22:59.070
my birthday

23:00.630 --> 23:01.510
a few days after that.

23:02.550 --> 23:03.390
What a coincidence.

23:04.150 --> 23:04.990
Really?

23:05.550 --> 23:06.270
Fate binds you

23:06.270 --> 23:07.710
to Jiyang, as you were born

23:08.510 --> 23:09.070
so close

23:09.390 --> 23:10.650
to the Water God Festival.

23:10.830 --> 23:11.380
Huanqing,

23:11.590 --> 23:12.150
we must

23:12.430 --> 23:13.390
celebrate her birthday

23:13.590 --> 23:14.390
properly.

23:14.830 --> 23:15.470
Alright.

23:21.070 --> 23:21.670
Master.

23:22.950 --> 23:23.540
Yuyan,

23:24.070 --> 23:24.950
may I have a word?

23:25.830 --> 23:26.420
Alright.

23:28.390 --> 23:29.390
Excuse me for a second.

23:35.710 --> 23:37.270
Those young ladies are waiting

23:37.590 --> 23:38.870
for you in the garden.

23:39.590 --> 23:40.390
What for?

23:41.270 --> 23:41.830
They are

23:41.830 --> 23:43.070
local noble ladies

23:43.510 --> 23:45.550
who genuinely wish to hear your music.

23:46.230 --> 23:46.870
So, they are

23:47.230 --> 23:48.510
waiting earnestly.

23:49.830 --> 23:51.470
Since those noble ladies

23:51.630 --> 23:52.590
are so earnest,

23:52.670 --> 23:54.030
I'll certainly meet them.

23:54.190 --> 23:55.190
Alright, let's go.

23:57.510 --> 23:58.740
A maiden departs,

23:58.910 --> 24:00.190
a world away from kin.

24:01.230 --> 24:02.360
- Look.
- Mrs. Qiao is here.

24:07.350 --> 24:08.630
I hear you noble ladies

24:08.670 --> 24:10.170
- are waiting for me.
- Mrs. Qiao.

24:11.790 --> 24:12.510
Not exactly.

24:13.630 --> 24:15.430
We are simply having

24:15.590 --> 24:16.510
casual conversations.

24:16.870 --> 24:17.510
I hope

24:17.510 --> 24:18.750
you don't mind our intrusion.

24:19.390 --> 24:20.390
The weather's fine.

24:20.990 --> 24:21.590
How about

24:21.790 --> 24:22.710
we host

24:22.710 --> 24:23.830
a poetry exchange here?

24:24.390 --> 24:25.510
Firstly for fun,

24:25.830 --> 24:26.510
secondly

24:26.910 --> 24:28.790
to admire Mrs. Qiao's literary talents.

24:29.350 --> 24:29.990
(Is she)

24:30.030 --> 24:31.190
(holding a grudge)

24:31.190 --> 24:32.030
(over the dress?)

24:32.830 --> 24:33.870
I have no desire

24:34.670 --> 24:35.630
for poetry, chess,

24:35.950 --> 24:36.870
or calligraphy.

24:37.350 --> 24:37.950
Nor will I

24:38.150 --> 24:39.150
play the zither.

24:40.110 --> 24:41.390
Do you disdain our company?

24:42.030 --> 24:43.270
You got me wrong.

24:43.630 --> 24:44.870
Would you like to talk about

24:45.390 --> 24:46.150
something

24:46.550 --> 24:47.390
more entertaining?

24:52.790 --> 24:53.510
I hear Miss He

24:53.510 --> 24:54.070
is pestered

24:54.070 --> 24:54.950
by those noble ladies.

24:56.910 --> 24:58.150
Can't you walk faster?

24:59.030 --> 24:59.630
What if

24:59.630 --> 25:00.790
they tear her apart

25:00.790 --> 25:01.790
and devour her alive?

25:02.670 --> 25:03.630
Even against ten men,

25:04.030 --> 25:05.070
let alone women,

25:05.710 --> 25:06.750
she'd still prevail.

25:07.150 --> 25:07.950
What do you know?

25:08.430 --> 25:09.270
Mean words

25:09.270 --> 25:10.430
hurt worse than blades.

25:12.590 --> 25:13.710
Didn't you hear me?

25:14.190 --> 25:15.390
Walk faster.

25:15.590 --> 25:16.550
Hurry up.

25:18.970 --> 25:19.830
I know

25:19.950 --> 25:21.230
you're concerned about

25:21.310 --> 25:22.990
my married life with my husband.

25:23.470 --> 25:23.870
True.

25:24.310 --> 25:25.430
We're deeply

25:25.790 --> 25:27.070
in love.

25:28.350 --> 25:29.230
I have

25:29.670 --> 25:30.510
a terrible temper

25:30.870 --> 25:32.270
and get sulky all the time.

25:32.590 --> 25:33.390
My husband

25:33.910 --> 25:35.430
has no choice but to appease me.

25:36.190 --> 25:37.670
He makes noodles for me

25:38.030 --> 25:39.070
and buys me jewelry

25:39.230 --> 25:40.070
and clothes.

25:40.550 --> 25:41.150
You were there

25:41.470 --> 25:43.390
when he was picking clothes for me,

25:43.950 --> 25:45.430
weren't you, Miss Yan?

25:46.190 --> 25:47.110
Therefore,

25:47.110 --> 25:48.670
what's the point

25:48.950 --> 25:49.870
of learning the arts?

25:50.230 --> 25:51.230
When I'm angry,

25:51.470 --> 25:52.310
my husband

25:52.350 --> 25:54.110
plays the zither

25:54.190 --> 25:55.510
to cheer me up.

25:56.910 --> 25:57.990
What you've glimpsed

25:58.270 --> 25:59.830
is merely the tip of the iceberg.

26:00.070 --> 26:00.870
The unseen devotion

26:01.270 --> 26:02.310
overflows endlessly.

26:04.470 --> 26:06.070
Such an extraordinary man,

26:06.430 --> 26:08.110
peerless among his contemporaries,

26:08.470 --> 26:10.750
chooses to shower affection
solely on me,

26:11.190 --> 26:12.550
seeing no one else.

26:12.660 --> 26:13.240
Tell me.

26:13.510 --> 26:14.550
What can I do?

26:14.740 --> 26:15.580
My bad.

26:15.710 --> 26:16.550
She doesn't need us.

26:16.870 --> 26:17.430
Let's go.

26:20.190 --> 26:20.950
Since we're here,

26:21.670 --> 26:22.430
let's hear

26:23.070 --> 26:24.070
what other nonsense

26:24.070 --> 26:25.030
she can spout.

26:25.510 --> 26:26.190
So,

26:26.590 --> 26:28.190
you're free to learn

26:28.630 --> 26:29.910
all those arts.

26:30.230 --> 26:31.110
But you should

26:31.310 --> 26:32.870
learn those for your own pleasure.

26:33.510 --> 26:35.070
If you want to please men,

26:35.430 --> 26:36.590
you'd better study

26:37.030 --> 26:38.350
the art of taming a husband.

26:38.710 --> 26:39.990
The art of taming a husband?

26:42.470 --> 26:43.150
Tell us

26:43.550 --> 26:44.710
what that is about.

26:45.750 --> 26:46.310
Yeah.

26:47.190 --> 26:48.270
My husband and I met

26:48.590 --> 26:50.070
during the Lantern Festival

26:50.150 --> 26:51.110
very briefly.

26:51.550 --> 26:52.630
We barely crossed paths.

26:52.910 --> 26:53.550
However,

26:53.750 --> 26:55.430
he came to propose the very next day,

26:56.110 --> 26:57.390
vowing to marry no one but me.

26:58.070 --> 26:59.270
He even threatened

26:59.590 --> 27:00.590
to hang himself

27:00.950 --> 27:02.110
if I refused.

27:06.910 --> 27:07.550
I thought

27:07.910 --> 27:09.470
I might as well do a good deed

27:09.870 --> 27:11.390
and save his life.

27:12.440 --> 27:13.080
Besides,

27:13.710 --> 27:15.390
even the most virtuous woman

27:15.990 --> 27:18.310
can't resist a persistent suitor.

27:19.110 --> 27:20.470
He pestered me relentlessly,

27:20.710 --> 27:22.030
so I had to marry him.

27:25.390 --> 27:26.110
You know what?

27:26.870 --> 27:28.070
The key to taming a man

27:28.550 --> 27:29.750
boils down to

27:30.510 --> 27:31.630
one principle.

27:32.670 --> 27:33.710
What is it?

27:35.990 --> 27:37.150
You may love him,

27:37.830 --> 27:40.390
but never lose yourself.

27:41.310 --> 27:42.990
In relationships,

27:42.990 --> 27:44.950
men and women should be equal.

27:45.630 --> 27:46.670
In trivial matters,

27:46.870 --> 27:48.350
one may take the upper hand,

27:48.670 --> 27:50.070
another the lower.

27:50.390 --> 27:51.710
It's just like warfare.

27:52.230 --> 27:53.910
If you constantly

27:53.910 --> 27:55.430
prioritize him,

27:55.710 --> 27:57.510
things may not end well.

27:57.990 --> 27:59.230
Treat yourself well,

27:59.550 --> 28:01.590
and love will find you naturally.

28:03.230 --> 28:03.790
Take me,

28:03.790 --> 28:04.390
for example.

28:04.870 --> 28:06.150
I never try to

28:06.190 --> 28:07.190
fawn over my husband,

28:07.470 --> 28:09.910
but he treasures me dearly.

28:10.430 --> 28:11.790
That's what I've achieved.

28:12.630 --> 28:13.670
I don't understand

28:13.790 --> 28:14.590
what she's saying,

28:15.110 --> 28:16.390
but it sounds impressive.

28:17.510 --> 28:18.990
Then, memorize

28:20.590 --> 28:21.510
everything she says.

28:22.150 --> 28:23.470
What nonsense?

28:23.870 --> 28:24.790
Women must adhere

28:25.030 --> 28:25.670
to the norms

28:25.670 --> 28:27.150
and obey their husbands

28:27.470 --> 28:28.830
once they're married.

28:29.350 --> 28:31.110
You are spouting nonsense here.

28:31.750 --> 28:32.950
Aren't you ashamed?

28:33.390 --> 28:34.430
Everyone should

28:34.750 --> 28:36.590
treat each other with equality

28:36.870 --> 28:37.710
and respect.

28:38.030 --> 28:39.030
Why'd I be ashamed?

28:39.670 --> 28:40.310
Or perhaps,

28:40.990 --> 28:42.070
you believe that

28:42.590 --> 28:44.790
you're born inferior to men.

28:47.030 --> 28:48.030
Women shouldn't

28:48.030 --> 28:49.110
be confined to

28:49.790 --> 28:51.030
inner chambers.

28:51.430 --> 28:52.710
The world is vast.

28:53.150 --> 28:53.710
We deserve

28:53.710 --> 28:54.790
a broader horizon.

28:56.190 --> 28:56.910
But...

28:57.790 --> 28:58.670
But we don't know

28:58.670 --> 28:59.750
where to begin.

29:02.150 --> 29:04.350
Travel ten thousand miles,
read ten thousand books.

29:04.950 --> 29:06.710
If it's difficult to travel,

29:07.070 --> 29:09.350
start with reading.

29:10.110 --> 29:11.390
We do read regularly.

29:12.790 --> 29:13.630
But there are

29:13.670 --> 29:14.710
many other books to read

29:14.710 --> 29:15.790
beyond the ones

29:16.110 --> 29:17.550
guiding you to be ladies.

29:17.870 --> 29:18.470
For example,

29:18.910 --> 29:20.390
we could read the books

29:20.670 --> 29:21.590
men read.

29:22.390 --> 29:23.010
Yeah.

29:28.870 --> 29:29.870
Take me, for example.

29:30.510 --> 29:31.750
I embrace all kinds

29:32.070 --> 29:32.910
of knowledge.

29:33.750 --> 29:34.910
I've even studied images

29:35.310 --> 29:36.470
with my husband.

29:36.910 --> 29:38.310
- What images?
- What images?

29:39.230 --> 29:40.910
Erotic...

29:41.110 --> 29:41.630
Honey.

29:41.630 --> 29:42.310
Images.

29:50.990 --> 29:51.790
What are you doing?

29:54.510 --> 29:55.380
Nothing.

29:56.230 --> 29:56.870
I'm just

29:57.430 --> 29:58.110
having tea

29:59.150 --> 30:00.350
with these ladies.

30:05.150 --> 30:06.070
Sisters,

30:06.100 --> 30:07.350
I'll take my leave.

30:15.710 --> 30:16.310
I've never

30:16.310 --> 30:17.510
seen someone so vulgar.

30:22.190 --> 30:23.290
It's exhausting.

30:24.750 --> 30:26.270
I sat upright all day.

30:26.950 --> 30:29.190
Acting like a woman is such a challenge.

30:29.430 --> 30:30.230
It's much worse

30:30.230 --> 30:32.030
than a full day's training.

30:32.280 --> 30:33.190
Acting like a woman?

30:33.790 --> 30:34.910
As if you're not

30:34.910 --> 30:35.430
a woman.

30:36.230 --> 30:36.870
Whose reputation

30:36.870 --> 30:38.070
are you trying to ruin?

30:38.670 --> 30:39.230
Yours

30:39.230 --> 30:40.350
or mine?

30:48.870 --> 30:49.790
Sorry, Commander.

30:50.630 --> 30:52.110
But I just don't get it.

30:52.590 --> 30:53.390
Jiyang City

30:53.590 --> 30:54.790
is governed by Her Highness.

30:55.150 --> 30:56.510
But why are the local women

30:56.550 --> 30:57.550
still bound by

30:57.550 --> 30:58.630
those outdated norms?

31:02.150 --> 31:03.070
But then again,

31:03.550 --> 31:04.510
women have been

31:04.730 --> 31:05.270
confined

31:05.270 --> 31:06.510
for thousands of years.

31:06.910 --> 31:07.830
How could they

31:08.110 --> 31:09.590
change overnight?

31:10.070 --> 31:11.430
How can I blame them?

31:16.830 --> 31:18.350
Your good looks caused trouble,

31:19.670 --> 31:21.110
and I bore the consequences.

31:29.950 --> 31:30.470
Commander,

31:31.270 --> 31:32.510
didn't you eat enough

31:32.510 --> 31:33.670
at the banquet?

31:36.710 --> 31:37.630
Someone was flustered

31:38.150 --> 31:38.830
at the banquet

31:39.310 --> 31:40.790
because of Ling Xiu

31:41.270 --> 31:42.230
and barely had food.

31:43.590 --> 31:44.470
So, these

31:44.830 --> 31:45.870
are for me?

31:47.670 --> 31:49.510
Thank you, Commander. You're so sweet.

31:49.710 --> 31:50.750
You're the best person

31:50.750 --> 31:51.510
in the world.

31:51.830 --> 31:52.910
Let's eat together.

31:53.270 --> 31:53.910
Dig in.

31:54.830 --> 31:55.610
Cut the flattery.

32:07.590 --> 32:08.310
Is your birthday

32:09.830 --> 32:10.830
really coming soon?

32:12.070 --> 32:13.430
According to the registry,

32:14.030 --> 32:15.110
it's in the summer.

32:18.350 --> 32:20.150
I just made it up.

32:20.550 --> 32:21.070
What if

32:21.430 --> 32:22.110
Mr. Cui gives me

32:22.110 --> 32:23.070
a birthday gift?

32:23.390 --> 32:24.510
It's my chance to make

32:24.550 --> 32:25.550
a good profit.

32:29.270 --> 32:29.870
Liar.

32:33.910 --> 32:34.590
What is it?

32:35.310 --> 32:35.830
Commander.

32:36.710 --> 32:37.670
We've located Chai Anxi.

32:41.110 --> 32:42.950
If you come along in this dress,

32:43.270 --> 32:43.830
you may

32:44.230 --> 32:44.990
arouse suspicion.

32:47.380 --> 32:47.900
Alright.

32:48.230 --> 32:48.870
Go ahead.

32:52.190 --> 32:52.790
Hurry up.

32:53.310 --> 32:54.110
You'll regret it

32:54.310 --> 32:55.350
if I change my mind.

33:19.150 --> 33:19.990
Have you seen a man

33:19.990 --> 33:20.550
in his forties

33:20.870 --> 33:21.910
with a limp

33:22.390 --> 33:23.310
on his left leg?

33:24.310 --> 33:24.870
No.

33:25.670 --> 33:26.990
He is crucial to us.

33:27.430 --> 33:28.790
He's served in the army.

33:29.070 --> 33:29.910
If you spot him

33:30.630 --> 33:31.630
one day,

33:31.710 --> 33:32.310
inform us.

33:32.710 --> 33:33.630
We'll reward you.

34:04.030 --> 34:04.600
Commander.

34:06.110 --> 34:06.870
Cuiwei Pavilion

34:07.110 --> 34:07.990
is a jewelry shop.

34:08.429 --> 34:09.150
A fire broke out

34:09.389 --> 34:10.270
two hours ago.

34:10.989 --> 34:12.110
The owner and the workers

34:12.230 --> 34:12.989
all survived.

34:13.630 --> 34:14.750
Only the new accountant

34:15.230 --> 34:15.909
with immobility

34:16.510 --> 34:17.110
died in there.

34:17.790 --> 34:18.350
And the body?

34:18.710 --> 34:19.270
It's inside.

34:19.590 --> 34:20.230
Want to see it?

34:24.949 --> 34:26.030
If I'm not mistaken,

34:26.580 --> 34:27.190
the body

34:27.190 --> 34:28.190
must be unrecognizable.

34:28.670 --> 34:29.870
Indeed.

34:30.630 --> 34:31.150
That is not

34:31.710 --> 34:32.750
Chai Anxi.

34:33.270 --> 34:33.830
Commander.

34:34.389 --> 34:35.190
Are you saying

34:35.630 --> 34:37.270
that he set the fire

34:37.909 --> 34:38.830
and faked his death?

34:39.870 --> 34:40.510
Makes sense.

34:41.230 --> 34:42.110
If I were Chai Anxi,

34:42.550 --> 34:43.949
who's wanted by the authorities,

34:44.469 --> 34:45.670
I'd fake my death

34:45.830 --> 34:46.750
rather than

34:47.230 --> 34:48.469
waiting to be caught.

34:48.989 --> 34:49.630
Security

34:50.270 --> 34:51.949
was tightened in Jiyang City

34:52.190 --> 34:52.830
after the fire.

34:53.510 --> 34:54.790
Chai Anxi is injured.

34:55.790 --> 34:57.270
He must be hiding in the city.

34:57.950 --> 34:58.910
I'll send people

34:59.220 --> 35:00.150
to search for him.

35:00.790 --> 35:01.590
We must hurry.

35:02.350 --> 35:03.310
Chu Zhao also has eyes

35:03.630 --> 35:04.630
fixed on Chai Anxi.

35:05.510 --> 35:06.630
We must beat him to it.

35:23.550 --> 35:24.430
They beat us to it.

35:25.510 --> 35:26.510
Should we go in?

35:27.350 --> 35:27.990
No need.

35:28.710 --> 35:29.310
Didn't you

35:29.870 --> 35:30.710
gather enough

35:30.710 --> 35:31.350
information?

35:32.030 --> 35:33.230
The witness only mentioned

35:33.550 --> 35:34.550
that someone died.

35:34.870 --> 35:35.830
That was convenient.

35:36.230 --> 35:36.910
Chai Anxi

35:37.190 --> 35:38.550
is prudent and cunning.

35:38.790 --> 35:39.550
This is merely

35:39.590 --> 35:40.870
a smokescreen.

35:43.390 --> 35:43.950
Let's go.

35:44.270 --> 35:45.390
We can't be spotted

35:45.590 --> 35:46.310
by Xiao Jue.

35:52.270 --> 35:52.950
Watch out.

36:27.110 --> 36:27.670
Young Master!

36:30.040 --> 36:31.260
(Xu)

36:36.030 --> 36:36.590
Let him go.

36:37.470 --> 36:38.150
Are you alright?

36:38.550 --> 36:39.110
I'm fine.

36:40.150 --> 36:40.950
Weird guy.

36:41.510 --> 36:42.510
He stalked us,

36:42.670 --> 36:43.510
suddenly attacked,

36:43.750 --> 36:44.590
and fled in haste.

36:45.310 --> 36:46.390
What does he want?

36:52.470 --> 36:53.790
Fashioning weapons from bones

36:55.070 --> 36:56.310
is a Wutuo custom.

36:58.070 --> 36:58.910
He's from Wutuo.

37:00.750 --> 37:01.430
But why was he

37:01.430 --> 37:03.110
interested in Chai Anxi?

37:03.470 --> 37:04.190
And why

37:05.190 --> 37:06.590
did he spare my life?

37:07.550 --> 37:08.190
Anyway,

37:08.750 --> 37:09.910
watch Xiao Jue's men.

37:10.550 --> 37:11.430
When the time comes,

37:12.190 --> 37:13.230
we'll strike first.

38:17.870 --> 38:20.020
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

38:20.130 --> 38:24.050
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

38:24.220 --> 38:26.170
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

38:26.260 --> 38:31.190
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

38:43.290 --> 38:44.690
